{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25798","headline":"忆过润州 · 李绅","name":"忆过润州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年从宦干戈地，黄绶青春一鲁儒。\n弓犯控弦招武旅，劒当抽匣问狂夫。\n帛书投笔封鱼腹，玄发冲冠捋虎须。\n谈笑谢金何所媿，不爲偷买用兵符。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25798.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25798","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}